## 6. Known Limitations & Design Decisions

| Topic | Reality |
|---|---|
| `inference_engine.py` uses relative path | `Path("models") / "registry" / model_id` works only when CWD = project root |
| `XAIExplainer._explain_tabular_batch()` | Uses variance proxy (std-dev of features), NOT real SHAP. Labeled clearly as `"proxy_method": "variance_proxy"` |
| `XAIExplainer._explain_image_batch()` | GradCAM is real (autodiff), but only `heatmap_shape/min/max` stored, not pixels |
| `XAIEngine.explain_image()` | Returns placeholder (`"gradcam_available": True`) — no actual CAM |
| `COGMASchemaDetector.fix4_engine` | Optional learnable target scorer; defaults to `None` (heuristic fallback) |
| `CandidateSelector` text/image probes | Real: TF-IDF+LR for text, ResNet50 transfer accuracy for image |
| `AdaptiveRetrainingPipeline.retrain()` | Delegates to `RetrainingPipeline` (lazy import avoids circular) |
| `MultiDatasetSchemaDetector` | Wraps `COGMASchemaDetector` + `Integrator` for cross-dataset aggregation |
| `ContextDatabase` (SQLite) | Stores `ExecutionContext` serialized as JSON blob; used by `SessionManager` |
| `EmbeddingCache` WDDM sync | `torch.cuda.synchronize()` called after every training/validation step for Windows TDR safety |

